{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\\left(d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{8}}}\\right) ^{5}\u0026=\\left(\\sqrt[8]{d}\\right)^5\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo $\\left(\\sqrt[8]{d}\\right)^5$ is correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\\left(d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{8}}}\\right)^5\u0026=d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac58}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left(d^5\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac18}}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo $\\left(d^5\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac18}}$ is correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\\left(d^5\\right)^8\u0026=d^{5\\cdot 8}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=d^{40}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026\\neq d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac58}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026= \\left(d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{8}}}\\right)^5\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo $\\left(d^5\\right)^8$ isn't correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, these are the correct answers:\n\n- $\\left(d^5\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{8}}}$\n- $\\left(\\sqrt[8]{d}\\right)^5$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $\\left(d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{8}}}\\right) ^{5}$ ?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\left(d^5\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{8}}}$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\left(d^5\\right)^8$","correct":false},{"content":"$\\left(\\sqrt[8]{d}\\right)^5$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
